DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
1557::$$$message_0007_0000_0000$$$::I set the tray down and get ready to retreat.[lr]::
1558::$$$message_0007_0000_0001$$$::"Yes...thank you for the tea.[lr]::
1559::$$$message_0007_0000_0002$$$::and for splurging on chocolate truffles."[lr]::
1560::$$$message_0007_0000_0003$$$::"Huh? Oh, Fuji-nee was in a bad mood, so I meant it as an apolo... Wait."::
1561::$$$message_0007_0001_0000$$$::I hear several sets of footsteps.[lr]::
1562::$$$message_0007_0001_0001$$$::Rather than passing by, they stop in front of the room.::
1563::$$$message_0007_0002_0000$$$::"Saber, can I have a moment?"[lr]::
1564::$$$message_0007_0002_0001$$$::"Nn!"[lr]::
1565::$$$message_0007_0002_0002$$$::S-Sakura!?[lr]::
1566::$$$message_0007_0002_0003$$$::Oh crap, this situation is getting very interesting!::
1567::$$$message_0007_0003_0000$$$::"Saber. Your shopping is mixed in with these bags."[lr]::
1568::$$$message_0007_0003_0001$$$::And if Rider's here, it's gone from interesting to terrifying...!::
1569::$$$message_0007_0004_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
1570::$$$message_0007_0004_0001$$$::"...!!!"[lr]::
1571::$$$message_0007_0004_0002$$$::An instant of eye contact. Nothing needs to be said. This is the only chance to escape...!::
1572::$$$message_0007_0005_0000$$$::...I hide in the closet.[lr]::
1573::$$$message_0007_0005_0001$$$::It's a cliché that I've seen in any number of things, but the only place a grown person could hide.::
1574::$$$message_0007_0006_0000$$$::"I'm coming in, Saber...[cacheimage storage=桜私服05d(中)][wvs][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wait canskip=0 time=500][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=桜私服05d(中)]..."[lr]::
1575::$$$message_0007_0006_0001$$$::...I'm not surprised she's speechless.[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
1576::$$$message_0007_0006_0002$$$::Who wouldn't be, after being greeted by a naked person?::
1577::$$$message_0007_0007_0000$$$::"...!?!?!?"[lr]::
1578::$$$message_0007_0007_0001$$$::...Though her panic sure seems to last a while.[lr]::
1579::$$$message_0007_0007_0002$$$::Sakura examines Saber from every angle, as if she were a museum exhibit.::
1580::$$$message_0007_0008_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
1581::$$$message_0007_0008_0001$$$::Saber could put on some clothes already, but remains naked.[lr]::
1582::$$$message_0007_0008_0002$$$::Rider stands there awkwardly.::
1583::$$$message_0007_0009_0000$$$::"Ah, how could I forget about Fleur?[lr]::
1584::$$$message_0007_0009_0001$$$::I'm sorry for the trouble, Sakura."[lr]::
1585::$$$message_0007_0009_0002$$$::"Oh, it's no... Wait, never mind that![lr]::
1586::$$$message_0007_0009_0003$$$::How... Were you always this skinny?"::
1587::$$$message_0007_0010_0000$$$::"Yes."[lr]::
1588::$$$message_0007_0010_0001$$$::"Even though you always ask for seconds, and never miss snack time at ten and three o'clock!?[lr]::
1589::$$$message_0007_0010_0002$$$::It isn't fair!"[lr]::
1590::$$$message_0007_0010_0003$$$::...Um.[lr]::
1591::$$$message_0007_0010_0004$$$::I have a feeling I just heard something I wasn't meant to.::
1592::$$$message_0007_0011_0000$$$::"But you eat quite a bit, too."[lr]::
1593::$$$message_0007_0011_0001$$$::"I'm not jealous that you eat a lot![lr]::
1594::$$$message_0007_0011_0002$$$::I-I mean, I do like eating good food, [cacheimage storage=桜私服05d(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=200][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=桜私服13i(中)]but I always worry that I have to go on a diet..."::
1595::$$$message_0007_0012_0000$$$::"Sakura, with your leave, I'd like to offer some advice."[lr]::
1596::$$$message_0007_0012_0001$$$::"Is there a hidden trick to it!?"[lr]::
1597::$$$message_0007_0012_0002$$$::"Food tastes better when you're not worrying about it all the time."[lr]::
1598::$$$message_0007_0012_0003$$$::"But I can't eat that much!"::
1599::$$$message_0007_0013_0000$$$::Sakura doesn't look fat to me, though...[lr]::
1600::$$$message_0007_0013_0001$$$::Girls are complicated.::
1601::$$$message_0007_0014_0000$$$::"Look, your upper arms don't have any flab on them, your stomach is firm and tight, and I can see the faint outline of your ribs..."::
1602::$$$message_0007_0015_0000$$$::"Have you mastered some secret English dieting technique!?[lr]::
1603::$$$message_0007_0015_0001$$$::Or have you secretly been doing aerobic exercise every day!?"[lr]::
1604::$$$message_0007_0015_0002$$$::"I feel like anyone but you should be saying that."::
1605::$$$message_0007_0016_0000$$$::"No, Sakura. I simply don't gain fat."[lr]::
1606::$$$message_0007_0016_0001$$$::"..."::
1607::$$$message_0007_0017_0000$$$::Saber hits her with a blazing fastball of a reply.[lr]::
1608::$$$message_0007_0017_0001$$$::Sakura freezes in a way that not even a batter who swings and misses three times would.::
1609::$$$message_0007_0018_0000$$$::"My physical growth was halted when I pulled the sword from the stone.[lr]::
1610::$$$message_0007_0018_0001$$$::Therefore, no matter how extravagant my meals, I never gain any weight. I also don't get any skinnier even if I don't eat anything at all."::
1611::$$$message_0007_0019_0000$$$::"...While I could never acquire a kingly physical stature, it did make certain aspects of combat more convenient.[lr]::
1612::$$$message_0007_0019_0001$$$::However, now it means that I will never acquire any womanly charms, so I do feel a measure of frustration from time to...[lr]::
1613::$$$message_0007_0019_0002$$$::...Sakura? Are you listening to me?"::
1614::$$$message_0007_0020_0000$$$::Oh, so that's why.[lr]::
1615::$$$message_0007_0020_0001$$$::Actually, I always thought it was weird.::
1616::$$$message_0007_0021_0000$$$::"...Rider, what's wrong with Sakura?"[lr]::
1617::$$$message_0007_0021_0001$$$::"You ought to know the power of words, Saber."::
1618::$$$message_0007_0022_0000$$$::"...That's strange.[lr]::
1619::$$$message_0007_0022_0001$$$::In the first place, Servants aren't easily affected by the physical laws of the current world. You should be well aware of this, as a Master.[lr]::
1620::$$$message_0007_0022_0002$$$::There's hardly any cause for[line len=2]"::
1621::$$$message_0007_0023_0000$$$::"Be strong, Sakura,[lr]::
1622::$$$message_0007_0023_0001$$$::so that you don't lose to such an insensitive Servant."[lr]::
1623::$$$message_0007_0023_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
1624::$$$message_0007_0023_0003$$$::"I'm no stranger to having a complex about my own body. I understand how you feel very well."[lr]::
1625::$$$message_0007_0023_0004$$$::"Ri...der...?"::
1626::$$$message_0007_0024_0000$$$::"Starting tonight, let's begin a diet together.[lr]::
1627::$$$message_0007_0024_0001$$$::I'll help you. We can start tracking your weight every night after you take a bath, and count your calories."[lr]::
1628::$$$message_0007_0024_0002$$$::"Ri...der..."[lr]::
1629::$$$message_0007_0024_0003$$$::"It's all right. I'll always be on your side, Sakura."::
1630::$$$message_0007_0025_0000$$$::"Rider...your build never changes either."[lr]::
1631::$$$message_0007_0025_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
1632::$$$message_0007_0025_0002$$$::Sakura, you're being pretty harsh on your fellow women!::
1633::$$$message_0007_0026_0000$$$::"Rider...don't tell me..."[lr]::
1634::$$$message_0007_0026_0001$$$::"Yes, I didn't mention it until now, but..."[lr]::
1635::$$$message_0007_0026_0002$$$::"You also... No. It's not true, right?"[lr]::
1636::$$$message_0007_0026_0003$$$::"I am a Servant, so no matter how much I eat...[cacheimage storage=ライダー私服04d(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服04d(中)]I won't get any taller."[lr]::
1637::$$$message_0007_0026_0004$$$::Huh? Were they talking about height?::
1638::$$$message_0007_0027_0000$$$::"You...traitor..."::
1639::$$$message_0007_0028_0000$$$::"Sakura, why are you turning to stone?[lr]::
1640::$$$message_0007_0028_0001$$$::Rider's Mystic Eyes aren't..."[lr]::
1641::$$$message_0007_0028_0002$$$::"Don't mind her.[lr]::
1642::$$$message_0007_0028_0003$$$::Lately, Sakura has been petrifying herself to avoid going into shock."[lr]::
1643::$$$message_0007_0028_0004$$$::"...I see. Her body composition is synchronizing with her Servant?"::
1644::$$$message_0007_0029_0000$$$::...I see.[lr]::
1645::$$$message_0007_0029_0001$$$::I have no idea how seriously Rider meant that, but I should try not to make Sakura turn to stone in the future.::
1646::$$$message_0007_0030_0000$$$::"I meant her no ill will."[lr]::
1647::$$$message_0007_0030_0001$$$::Yes, you just stated the cruel facts of the world.::
1648::$$$message_0007_0031_0000$$$::"In that case, we'll be taking our leave."[lr]::
1649::$$$message_0007_0031_0001$$$::"Take care."::
1650::$$$message_0007_0032_0000$$$::"...[lr]::
1651::$$$message_0007_0032_0001$$$::...[lr]::
1652::$$$message_0007_0032_0002$$$::...[lr]::
1653::$$$message_0007_0032_0003$$$::[se storage=se040.wav][sestop storage=se349.wav time=200 nowait=1][resumevoice]...She's heavy."::
1654::$$$message_0007_0033_0000$$$::"S-something terrible is happening to Sakura!"[lr]::
1655::$$$message_0007_0033_0001$$$::"Huh? No, this always happens. It always happens!"::
1656::$$$message_0007_0034_0000$$$::...They're gone.[lr]::
1657::$$$message_0007_0034_0001$$$::I should be able to come out now...::
1658::$$$message_0007_0035_0000$$$::"...Ah."[lr]::
1659::$$$message_0007_0035_0001$$$::...Never mind!::
1660::$$$message_0007_0036_0000$$$::"They get along heartwarmingly well, those two."[lr]::
1661::$$$message_0007_0036_0001$$$::"Okay, but put something on...[lr]::
1662::$$$message_0007_0036_0002$$$::...Oh yeah, your armor."[lr]::
1663::$$$message_0007_0036_0003$$$::"I see. That is logical."::
1664::$$$message_0007_0037_0000$$$::Saber's clothing crisis has finally been resolved.[lr]::
1665::$$$message_0007_0037_0001$$$::I'm the one who's most relieved.[lr]::
1666::$$$message_0007_0037_0002$$$::The surge of relief makes me say it before I can stop myself.::
1667::$$$message_0007_0038_0000$$$::"Saber.[lr]::
1668::$$$message_0007_0038_0001$$$::About the swimsuit topic earlier..."[lr]::
1669::$$$message_0007_0038_0002$$$::"Yes?"[lr]::
1670::$$$message_0007_0038_0003$$$::"There's a more appropriate place to show me than here, right?[lr]::
1671::$$$message_0007_0038_0004$$$::Want to go to the pool in Shinto next time?"::
1672::$$$message_0007_0039_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
1673::$$$message_0007_0039_0001$$$::This isn't really like me.[lr]::
1674::$$$message_0007_0039_0002$$$::I blurt it out, and then scratch my cheek after the fact.::
1675::$$$message_0007_0040_0000$$$::"Well, uh, I heard there was a new pool in Shinto, so..."[lr]::
1676::$$$message_0007_0040_0001$$$::It's quiet for a moment.[lr]::
1677::$$$message_0007_0040_0002$$$::Saber inhales slightly.::
1678::$$$message_0007_0041_0000$$$::"Yes. I'd be happy to accompany you."[lr]::
1679::$$$message_0007_0041_0001$$$::And just like that, she accepts my invitation.::

